	<section_number>1-216</section_number>
	<catch_line>Gender</catch_line>
	<text>
		A word used in the masculine includes the feminine and neuter.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1919, § 5; Code 1950, § 1-13; 1950, p. 21, § 1-13.7; 1997, c. 406; 2005, c. 839.</history>
